Creed has a talking head where he says, so there I am, minding my own business and Darnell
克里德有一段采访，他说，当时我正忙着自己的事，达内尔

1317
00:54:28.920 --> 00:54:30.120
offers me three bucks.
给了我三块钱。

1318
00:54:30.120 --> 00:54:33.000
All I got to do is walk by Andy and go like this.
我只要从安迪身边走过，做这个动作就行。

1319
00:54:33.660 --> 00:54:34.300
Darnell's a chump.
达内尔真是个傻瓜。

1320
00:54:34.380 --> 00:54:35.460
I would have done it for anything.
我本来什么价钱都肯做的。

1321
00:54:35.680 --> 00:54:37.380
I've done a lot more for a lot less.
我做过比这多得多的事，拿的钱还更少。

1322
00:54:37.380 --> 00:54:40.780
I noticed the recurring $3.
我注意到了那个反复出现的三美元。

1323
00:54:41.760 --> 00:54:42.240
Remember?
记得吗？

1324
00:54:42.760 --> 00:54:45.180
Didn't Creed have a $3 bill earlier?
克里德之前不是有张三美元钞票吗？

1325
00:54:45.400 --> 00:54:45.800
Yes.
是的。

1326
00:54:46.180 --> 00:54:48.180
With, I thought it was Brad Pitt.
我当时以为上面印的是布拉德·皮特。

1327
00:54:48.480 --> 00:54:50.000
Turns out it was George W.
结果发现是乔治·W·

1328
00:54:50.160 --> 00:54:50.360
Bush.
布什。

1329
00:54:50.560 --> 00:54:56.140
Well, there is a candy bag alt for the second part of Creed's talking head.
嗯，克里德那段采访的后半部分还有一个糖果袋的备选方案。

1330
00:54:56.200 --> 00:54:56.480
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1331
00:54:57.040 --> 00:55:00.840
Instead of saying I would have done it for anything, I've done a lot more for a lot less.
他没说“我本来什么价钱都肯做的，我做过比这多得多的事，拿的钱还更少”。

1332
00:55:01.820 --> 00:55:07.100
Creed's alt that they did shoot, it was a must shoot, was, can you believe it?
克里德拍的那个备选方案，是必须要拍的，他说的是，你能相信吗？

1333
00:55:07.380 --> 00:55:12.120
I thought this was going to be a terrible week, what with my mom dying, but life surprises
我本以为这周会很糟糕，毕竟我妈刚去世，但生活有时就是会给你惊喜。

1334
00:55:12.120 --> 00:55:12.840
you sometimes.
天哪。

1335
00:55:13.360 --> 00:55:14.460
Oh, my God.
我知道。

1336
00:55:14.600 --> 00:55:15.520
I know.
天哪，克里德。

1337
00:55:16.120 --> 00:55:16.980
Oh, Creed.
哦，克里德。

1338
00:55:17.800 --> 00:55:23.780
Well, this Andy storyline would have continued with this scene between Aaron and Andy in the
嗯，安迪的这条故事线本应在厨房里亚伦和安迪的这场戏中继续。

1339
00:55:23.780 --> 00:55:24.160
kitchen.
真的吗？

1340
00:55:24.760 --> 00:55:25.220
Really?
是的，自从他们分手后，我们就没再见过亚伦和安迪之间有什么互动了。

1341
00:55:25.540 --> 00:55:28.900
Yeah, we haven't seen anything between Aaron and Andy since their breakup.
没错。

1342
00:55:29.080 --> 00:55:29.480
Yes.
但他们确实有一整场戏。

1343
00:55:29.680 --> 00:55:30.900
But they had a whole scene.
我们上周简短地聊过，我说过我会分享的。

1344
00:55:31.060 --> 00:55:33.780
We talked about it briefly last week, and I said I would share.
在拍摄剧本中，安迪走进厨房，走向坐在桌边的亚伦。

1345
00:55:33.780 --> 00:55:38.760
In the shooting draft, Andy enters the kitchen and walks over to Aaron, who is seated at
她抬头笑了笑。

1346
00:55:38.760 --> 00:55:39.180
the table.
他看了看身后，在桌边坐了下来。

1347
00:55:39.380 --> 00:55:41.000
She looks up and smiles.
安迪说，我想我发现了一件大事，如果我出了什么事，

1348
00:55:41.500 --> 00:55:44.100
He looks behind him and takes a seat at the table.
我希望你读读这封信。

1349
00:55:44.800 --> 00:55:49.720
Andy says, I think I've uncovered something pretty big, and if anything happens to me,
（注：此处原文编号48对应内容为“安迪说，我想我发现了一件大事，如果我出了什么事，”）

1350
00:55:49.880 --> 00:55:51.760
I want you to read this letter.
（注：此处原文编号49对应内容为“我希望你读读这封信。”）

1351
00:55:51.960 --> 00:55:54.720
It has every feeling I've ever felt about you.
这里面有我对你产生过的所有感觉。

1352
00:55:55.640 --> 00:55:59.000
Everything I've ever wanted to say to you, but didn't have the courage.
所有我一直想对你说，却没勇气说出口的话。

1353
00:55:59.000 --> 00:56:00.920
I put it all in this letter.
我都写在这封信里了。

1354
00:56:01.120 --> 00:56:02.540
He slides it to her.
他把信推给她。

1355
00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:08.220
He then goes on to say, however, and I can't be clearer on this point.
然后他接着说，这一点我必须说得再清楚不过。

1356
00:56:08.260 --> 00:56:14.740
If nothing happens to me, absolutely do not under any circumstances read this letter.
如果我没出什么事，无论如何，绝对不要读这封信。

1357
00:56:15.100 --> 00:56:17.140
And Aaron says, okay.
亚伦说，好的。

1358
00:56:18.460 --> 00:56:19.760
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1359
00:56:20.220 --> 00:56:21.520
That is crazy.
太疯狂了。

1360
00:56:22.300 --> 00:56:28.540
Well, now there's going to be a big break in the case of, is Donna cheating?
好吧，现在关于唐娜是否出轨的案子要有重大突破了。

1361
00:56:29.220 --> 00:56:30.940
Cam is a mom detective.
卡姆是个妈妈侦探。

1362
00:56:31.280 --> 00:56:32.520
She sure is.
她确实是。

1363
00:56:33.420 --> 00:56:38.000
Turns out, she and Donna have a friend of a friend in common on Facebook, and she was
结果发现，她和唐娜在脸书上有共同好友，所以她

1364
00:56:38.000 --> 00:56:40.040
able to see some of Donna's posts.
能看到唐娜的一些动态。

1365
00:56:40.920 --> 00:56:45.200
Now, first of all, obviously, Michael doesn't follow Donna on Facebook.
首先，很明显，迈克尔并没有在脸书上关注唐娜。

1366
00:56:46.220 --> 00:56:46.780
No.
没错。

1367
00:56:47.120 --> 00:56:50.900
Because there are pictures of her canoodling with another man.
因为上面有她和另一个男人亲热的照片。

1368
00:56:51.480 --> 00:56:52.900
There's multiple pictures.
有好几张照片。

1369
00:56:53.280 --> 00:56:53.720
Yeah.
是啊。

1370
00:56:54.060 --> 00:57:01.520
So, we're going to come to find out in this episode that Donna is married, and the person
所以，我们在这一集里会发现唐娜其实已经结婚了，而照片里

1371
00:57:01.520 --> 00:57:04.480
she's kissing in these photos is her husband.
和她接吻的那个人就是她丈夫。

1372
00:57:04.760 --> 00:57:05.060
Yeah.
没错。

1373
00:57:05.660 --> 00:57:10.480
And this character of Donna's husband is going to show up next week.
唐娜丈夫这个角色下周就会出现。

1374
00:57:10.620 --> 00:57:11.340
Spoiler alert.
剧透预警。

1375
00:57:12.380 --> 00:57:19.100
Randy told me that the actor who is going to play Donna's husband, named Shane, had been
兰迪告诉我，那个要扮演唐娜丈夫——名叫肖恩——的演员，是

1376
00:57:19.100 --> 00:57:20.780
hired for the following week.
在接下来的一周被雇佣的。

1377
00:57:20.940 --> 00:57:22.920
His name was Larkin Campbell.
他的名字叫拉金·坎贝尔。

1378
00:57:23.200 --> 00:57:30.240
So, they contacted Allison Jones, and Allison gave them a general description of Larkin, and
所以，他们联系了艾莉森·琼斯，艾莉森给了他们拉金的大致外貌描述，然后

1379
00:57:30.240 --> 00:57:35.540
they cast a background artist to stand in and be a photo double so that they could take
他们找了一位背景演员来充当替身，这样他们就能拍下

1380
00:57:35.540 --> 00:57:39.500
the pictures for this episode for Pam to have as a prop.
这一集里帕姆作为道具拿在手里的那些照片。

1381
00:57:40.300 --> 00:57:45.700
These photos were shot by Michael Gallenberg on a green screen over on the warehouse stage,
这些照片是由迈克尔·加伦伯格在仓库摄影棚的绿幕前拍摄的，

1382
00:57:45.920 --> 00:57:52.360
and Henry Sane built the Photoshop composite and the Facebook printouts that Pam holds up.
亨利·塞恩制作了照片合成图和帕姆举着的脸书打印件。

1383
00:57:52.620 --> 00:57:55.460
A lot went into these printouts.
这些打印件花了不少心思。

1384
00:57:55.660 --> 00:57:55.980
Yeah.
是啊。

1385
00:57:55.980 --> 00:58:00.620
Including Amy Peet's having to, like, kiss a random fella for these pictures.
包括艾米·皮茨为了这些照片不得不去亲吻一个陌生男人。

1386
00:58:01.400 --> 00:58:02.340
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

1387
00:58:02.660 --> 00:58:02.960
Right?
对吧？

1388
00:58:03.240 --> 00:58:03.500
Yeah.
是啊。

1389
00:58:04.080 --> 00:58:05.880
These are details you don't think about.
这些都是你平时不会注意到的细节。

1390
00:58:06.860 --> 00:58:10.840
Also, I just want to say, Pam also shows a photo of Cece.
另外，我还想说，帕姆还展示了一张西西的照片。

1391
00:58:11.160 --> 00:58:11.540
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1392
00:58:11.860 --> 00:58:13.740
That was a photo of my real niece, Cece.
那是我的亲侄女西西的照片。

1393
00:58:13.740 --> 00:58:15.460
Oh, it's such a cute picture.
噢，那张照片真可爱。

1394
00:58:15.460 --> 00:58:15.900
I know.
我知道。

1395
00:58:16.040 --> 00:58:17.760
It's at 15 minutes and 35 seconds.
在15分35秒的时候。

1396
00:58:17.800 --> 00:58:19.400
It's so crazy cute.
可爱得不得了。

1397
00:58:20.560 --> 00:58:26.200
Well, Pam is going to take these pictures in a folder and march into Michael's office where
好吧，帕姆拿着这些照片走进文件夹，大步走进迈克尔的办公室，

1398
00:58:26.200 --> 00:58:28.220
he is sitting with Donna.
当时他正和唐娜坐在一起。

1399
00:58:28.640 --> 00:58:32.060
It looks like they're looking at places to stay in Vero Beach.
看起来他们正在看维罗海滩的住宿地点。

1400
00:58:32.220 --> 00:58:32.580
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1401
00:58:32.980 --> 00:58:39.160
And this was a bit of a stretch for me, that Pam would hand Michael these pictures when
对我来说，帕姆在迈克尔坐在唐娜旁边时把这些照片递给他，这有点牵强，

1402
00:58:39.160 --> 00:58:40.800
he is seated next to Donna.
他当时正坐在唐娜旁边。

1403
00:58:40.980 --> 00:58:42.880
And Donna, what, doesn't even glance over?
而且唐娜，怎么说呢，连看都不看一眼吗？

1404
00:58:43.000 --> 00:58:44.960
She doesn't even see what he's looking at?
她甚至没看到他在看什么吗？

1405
00:58:45.080 --> 00:58:47.040
Pam tries to get Michael out of the room.
帕姆试图把迈克尔带出房间。

1406
00:58:47.040 --> 00:58:51.320
She says, Michael, I need to discuss my sex life with you.
她说，迈克尔，我需要和你讨论一下我的性生活。

1407
00:58:51.420 --> 00:58:51.720
I know.
我知道。

1408
00:58:51.860 --> 00:58:53.360
She's desperate to get him out of that room.
她拼命想把他带出那个房间。

1409
00:58:53.460 --> 00:58:55.620
I mean, what else is she supposed to say?
我是说，她还能说什么呢？

1410
00:58:55.800 --> 00:58:59.500
She makes up multiple reasons for him to leave the room with her, and he will not.
她编造了各种理由让他跟她离开房间，但他就是不肯。

1411
00:58:59.640 --> 00:59:00.920
My issue is not with Pam.
我的问题不在帕姆身上。

1412
00:59:01.120 --> 00:59:07.780
My issue is, how is it that Donna doesn't just glance over and see what Michael is looking at?
我的问题是，唐娜怎么就不能看一眼，看看迈克尔在看什么呢？

1413
00:59:07.880 --> 00:59:11.780
Because she's too invested in finding a good vacation spot.
因为她太专注于寻找一个好的度假地点了。

1414
00:59:11.840 --> 00:59:12.200
Okay.
好吧。

1415
00:59:12.740 --> 00:59:14.960
I absolutely loved filming this scene.
我非常喜欢拍摄这场戏。

1416
00:59:14.960 --> 00:59:19.480
I had so much fun with Steve, so much of that dialogue and back and forth we kind of
我和史蒂夫合作得非常开心，很多对话和互动都是我们

1417
00:59:19.480 --> 00:59:20.320
found on the day.
在拍摄当天即兴发挥出来的。

1418
00:59:20.880 --> 00:59:22.100
I figured you did.
我猜到了。

1419
00:59:22.220 --> 00:59:23.500
It looked like you guys were having fun.
看起来你们玩得很开心。

1420
00:59:23.860 --> 00:59:30.060
I also want to point out, at 16 minutes, in the background, Phyllis is not at her desk.
我还想指出，在16分钟的时候，背景里菲利斯不在她的座位上。

1421
00:59:30.860 --> 00:59:36.200
John is at his desk, and Creed is standing at Dwight's desk.
约翰在座位上，克里德站在德怀特的桌子旁。

1422
00:59:36.800 --> 00:59:44.080
The reason for this was that Phyllis could not be in the background that day, and Rain, who was directing, could not be in the background.
原因是那天菲利斯不能出现在背景里，而担任导演的雷恩也不能出现在背景里。

1423
00:59:44.120 --> 00:59:51.680
So, in order to fill out that area, he had Creed step forward and stand at Dwight's desk.
所以，为了填补那个区域，他让克里德走上前去，站在德怀特的桌子旁。

1424
00:59:52.720 --> 00:59:56.560
Michael and Pam are outside advanced refrigeration, where Michael is flipping out.
迈克尔和帕姆在高级制冷公司外面，迈克尔当时快崩溃了。

1425
00:59:57.080 --> 00:59:58.960
He's freaking out with this new information.
他被这个新消息吓坏了。

1426
00:59:59.800 --> 01:00:00.160
Yeah.
没错。

1427
01:00:00.480 --> 01:00:02.820
Michael does not know what to do with this information.
迈克尔不知道该怎么处理这个消息。

1428
01:00:02.900 --> 01:00:11.000
He walks Donna to her car, and he's kind of trying to trick her by making plans for the weekend, but then changing them.
他送唐娜去车边，试图通过制定周末计划然后又改变计划来欺骗她。

1429
01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:15.480
Yeah, to Tuesday, and then she's like, oh, but I can do Tuesday, and...
是啊，改到周二，然后她说，哦，但我周二有空，然后……

1430
01:00:15.480 --> 01:00:21.800
Finally, Michael tells Donna he knows that she's cheating on him because Pam told him.
最后，迈克尔告诉唐娜，他知道她在背着他出轨，因为帕姆告诉了他。

1431
01:00:21.920 --> 01:00:26.480
And then he looks up, and Jenna, you, like, spring.
然后他抬头看，珍娜，你就像，弹射出去一样。

1432
01:00:26.980 --> 01:00:31.900
Like, talk about this athletic move where you, like, lunge and dive forward onto the ground.
说说这个运动动作吧，你就像猛冲并扑倒在地上一样。

1433
01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:36.680
We got a fan question from Kelsey B in North Carolina who said,
我们收到了北卡罗来纳州凯尔西·B发来的粉丝提问，她说，

1434
01:00:36.720 --> 01:00:40.240
I love when Pam hits the floor so that Donna doesn't see her.
我喜欢帕姆扑倒在地，这样唐娜就看不到她了。

1435
01:00:40.860 --> 01:00:41.920
Was this scripted?
这是剧本里写的吗？

1436
01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:43.500
Because it's absolutely hilarious.
因为这太搞笑了。

1437
01:00:44.340 --> 01:00:44.900
Yes.
是的。

1438
01:00:45.180 --> 01:00:46.800
That moment was scripted.
那一刻是剧本里写的。

1439
01:00:47.080 --> 01:00:49.580
In the script, it says, Pam hits the floor.
剧本里写着，帕姆扑倒在地。

1440
01:00:49.980 --> 01:00:51.760
And it was so fun to shoot.
拍摄的时候非常有趣。

1441
01:00:51.760 --> 01:00:53.040
We kept laughing.
我们一直在笑。

1442
01:00:53.640 --> 01:00:59.920
I just kept trying to fling myself on the floor in the most ridiculous way every time we were cracking up.
每次我们笑场的时候，我都会试着以最滑稽的方式把自己扔到地板上。

1443
01:01:00.100 --> 01:01:01.520
We had a lot of fun with that moment.
我们在那一刻玩得很开心。

1444
01:01:02.980 --> 01:01:10.620
But this is when Michael is going to find out that he, he is the person she's cheating with.
但就在这时，迈克尔要发现他，他就是那个她出轨的对象。

1445
01:01:10.880 --> 01:01:12.500
Yeah, he's the other guy.
没错，他就是那个“第三者”。

1446
01:01:13.060 --> 01:01:17.000
And next week, we're going to learn what Michael's feelings are about that.
下周，我们将了解迈克尔对此的感受。

1447
01:01:17.280 --> 01:01:18.660
About being the other fella.
关于成为那个“第三者”的感受。

1448
01:01:18.920 --> 01:01:19.180
Yeah.
是的。

1449
01:01:19.180 --> 01:01:27.720
At 18 minutes, four seconds, Gabe is going to tell Andy that they have investigated all of the instances of faulty printers.
在18分04秒，盖博要告诉安迪，他们已经调查了所有打印机故障的案例。

1450
01:01:27.720 --> 01:01:29.760
In every case, it was user error.
在每一个案例中，都是用户操作失误。

1451
01:01:30.080 --> 01:01:35.660
He's going to really creepily offer him a $5 Dunkin' Donuts gift card.
他打算用一张5美元的唐恩都乐礼品卡，以一种非常令人毛骨悚然的方式去贿赂他。

1452
01:01:35.660 --> 01:01:39.020
Yeah, like as a thank you for bringing this to our attention.
没错，就说是为了感谢他向我们反映这个问题。

1453
01:01:39.620 --> 01:01:40.720
Andy seems happy.
安迪看起来很高兴。

1454
01:01:40.960 --> 01:01:44.760
And then Daryl shakes him off like, nope, uh-uh, something's still going on.
然后达里尔拒绝了他，意思是“不，不行，肯定还有什么猫腻”。

1455
01:01:44.980 --> 01:01:45.660
That's right.
没错。

1456
01:01:46.120 --> 01:01:52.820
He manages to convince Andy to film himself using one of these printers.
他设法说服安迪亲自录一段使用这种打印机的视频。

1457
01:01:53.140 --> 01:01:56.820
They're down in the defunct Michael Scott Paper Company room.
他们是在那个已经废弃的迈克尔·斯科特造纸公司的房间里。

1458
01:01:57.320 --> 01:01:59.500
Remember, Michael rented that space forever.
别忘了，迈克尔租那个地方租了很久。

1459
01:01:59.500 --> 01:02:00.220
It's there.
它还在那儿。

1460
01:02:00.440 --> 01:02:01.800
Yeah, he's going to have it for a while.
是啊，他还要在那儿待上一阵子。

1461
01:02:01.800 --> 01:02:04.740
Well, in the shooting draft, the scene was described like this.
嗯，在拍摄剧本里，这一幕是这样描述的。

1462
01:02:04.960 --> 01:02:06.860
Interior Michael Scott Paper Company.
内景，迈克尔·斯科特造纸公司。

1463
01:02:07.120 --> 01:02:10.340
It barely resembles the old MSPC.
它几乎看不出以前迈克尔·斯科特造纸公司的样子了。

1464
01:02:10.760 --> 01:02:14.660
There's some garbage in the corner and a few motivational posters on the wall.
角落里堆着些垃圾，墙上贴着几张励志海报。

1465
01:02:14.880 --> 01:02:19.180
A saber printer is set up on a ledge, and it is printing many copies.
一台Saber打印机架在窗台上，正在疯狂打印。

1466
01:02:19.940 --> 01:02:24.460
Daryl videotapes Andy with the printer in the background, and the printer is printing.
达里尔给安迪录像，打印机在背景里，正在运作。

1467
01:02:25.280 --> 01:02:29.900
Well, Randy told me that they didn't think we were ever going to use that space again,
兰迪告诉我，他们本来以为我们再也不会用那个空间了，

1468
01:02:29.900 --> 01:02:33.800
and they had converted it back to being a post-production storeroom.
所以他们把它改回了后期制作的储藏室。

1469
01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:34.740
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1470
01:02:34.760 --> 01:02:36.000
They had to move everything out.
他们不得不把里面的东西全搬走。

1471
01:02:36.000 --> 01:02:36.600
They did.
确实如此。

1472
01:02:36.760 --> 01:02:38.540
They had to take everything back out again.
他们又得把所有东西再搬出来。

1473
01:02:38.760 --> 01:02:42.740
He said, luckily, they had left the fakie shower and the kind of stained walls.
他说，幸运的是，他们留下了那个假淋浴间和那种有污渍的墙壁。

1474
01:02:43.060 --> 01:02:48.360
But he said our set deck team, headed by Steve Rothstein and the lead man, Jim McDermott,
但他提到我们的布景团队，由史蒂夫·罗斯坦领导，还有领班吉姆·麦克德莫特，

1475
01:02:48.560 --> 01:02:52.240
had to totally recover that space, basically.
基本上得把那个空间完全重新布置一遍。

1476
01:02:53.040 --> 01:02:56.060
Well, Andy is putting on the presentation of this printer.
嗯，安迪正在演示这台打印机。

1477
01:02:56.520 --> 01:02:58.540
Daryl keeps making him talk in a higher voice.
达里尔一直让他用更高的嗓音说话。

1478
01:02:58.680 --> 01:02:58.920
Yes.
没错。

1479
01:02:58.920 --> 01:03:02.780
And now he's talking really high, and guess what starts happening?
现在他说话声音变得特别尖，你猜怎么着？

1480
01:03:03.020 --> 01:03:06.160
The printer starts smoking and catches on fire.
打印机开始冒烟，然后着火了。

1481
01:03:06.480 --> 01:03:08.300
Daryl is genuinely shocked.
达里尔是真的被吓到了。

1482
01:03:09.020 --> 01:03:13.980
Randy told me that the printer in this scene was rigged by Ron Nary, our head of special effects,
兰迪告诉我，这一幕里的打印机是由我们的特效主管罗恩·纳里改装的，

1483
01:03:14.180 --> 01:03:18.560
and our on-set effects person, Mike Thompson, was there to kind of make it all work.
我们的现场特效人员迈克·汤普森也在场，负责确保一切顺利运作。

1484
01:03:19.280 --> 01:03:25.660
First, they had to hide a remote-controlled electronic smoke generator, which produced the safe smoke,
首先，他们得藏好一个遥控电子烟雾发生器，用来产生安全的烟雾，

1485
01:03:25.840 --> 01:03:29.760
which is very similar to what we used in that fire drill, the opening of stress relief.
这和我们在《压力缓解》开场那场火灾演习里用的是一样的。

1486
01:03:29.760 --> 01:03:37.200
And then the sparks were created using squibs, which were similar to what we used to make Andy's battery spark in Mafia.
然后用小型爆炸装置制造火花，这和我们在《黑手党》那集里让安迪的电池冒火花用的装置类似。

1487
01:03:38.300 --> 01:03:43.200
And then finally, he told me that Craig used a real CO2 fire extinguisher.
最后，他告诉我克雷格用了一个真正的二氧化碳灭火器。

1488
01:03:44.260 --> 01:03:45.240
That looked real.
看起来真像那么回事。

1489
01:03:45.420 --> 01:03:46.320
I thought so, too.
我也这么觉得。

1490
01:03:46.720 --> 01:03:50.080
But did you notice the fakie labels on the printer that say saber?
但你注意到打印机上贴的那些写着“Saber”的假标签了吗？

1491
01:03:51.060 --> 01:03:52.660
If you look close, there's two.
仔细看的话，有两个。

1492
01:03:52.820 --> 01:03:53.580
Fakie label.
假标签。

1493
01:03:53.720 --> 01:03:54.120
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1494
01:03:54.540 --> 01:03:59.800
This moment is going to sober up Daryl pretty quickly.
这一刻会让达里尔很快清醒过来。

1495
01:04:00.080 --> 01:04:00.520
That's right.
没错。

1496
01:04:00.520 --> 01:04:02.420
He's going to have a talking head where he says,
他会有一个采访镜头，他说，

1497
01:04:02.700 --> 01:04:04.260
I don't want to prank anymore.
我不想再搞恶作剧了。

1498
01:04:04.660 --> 01:04:05.660
Things get real.
事情变得严重了。

1499
01:04:05.820 --> 01:04:06.660
It's not funny.
这一点都不好笑。

1500
01:04:06.840 --> 01:04:08.040
I'm just going to be good.
我还是老老实实做人吧。

1501
01:04:08.300 --> 01:04:09.080
Stay in my room.
待在我的房间里。

1502
01:04:09.220 --> 01:04:10.120
Go to church.
去教堂。

1503
01:04:10.560 --> 01:04:12.240
Try to do one nice thing per day.
试着每天做一件好事。

1504
01:04:12.420 --> 01:04:14.480
I do not want to prank anymore.
我不想再搞恶作剧了。

1505
01:04:15.220 --> 01:04:16.360
No more pranks.
不再有恶作剧了。

1506
01:04:16.800 --> 01:04:18.000
I don't like pranks.
我不喜欢恶作剧。

1507
01:04:18.420 --> 01:04:18.820
Myself.
我自己。

1508
01:04:19.580 --> 01:04:20.580
We've talked about this.
我们谈过这件事了。

1509
01:04:20.640 --> 01:04:21.060
I hate pranks.
我讨厌恶作剧。

1510
01:04:21.100 --> 01:04:21.380
I know.
我知道。

1511
01:04:21.480 --> 01:04:22.100
We hate pranks.
我们都讨厌恶作剧。

1512
01:04:22.220 --> 01:04:23.340
We're on board with Daryl.
我们支持达里尔。

1513
01:04:23.560 --> 01:04:25.440
Daryl, stay away from the pranking.
达里尔，离恶作剧远点。

1514
01:04:25.700 --> 01:04:28.480
This episode ends with Dwight back at the gym.
这一集结尾德怀特回到了健身房。

1515
01:04:28.480 --> 01:04:31.580
He has aggressively taken over a spin class.
他强势接管了一节动感单车课。

1516
01:04:32.200 --> 01:04:33.200
Guest star alert.
客串明星预警。

1517
01:04:33.400 --> 01:04:35.820
The spin instructor was played by David Mate.
动感单车教练由大卫·梅特饰演。

1518
01:04:36.080 --> 01:04:39.000
And according to IMDb, he played professional ice hockey in Europe.
根据IMDb显示，他曾在欧洲打过职业冰球。

1519
01:04:39.880 --> 01:04:40.740
I know.
我知道。

1520
01:04:41.280 --> 01:04:45.620
When we reached out to Rain, he said he absolutely loved doing the scene.
当我们联系雷恩时，他说他非常喜欢拍这场戏。

1521
01:04:45.640 --> 01:04:52.800
And he said he thinks the writers had for a while this idea that Dwight would take over an exercise class.
他说他觉得编剧们早就想过让德怀特去接管健身课这个点子了。

1522
01:04:52.860 --> 01:04:54.100
It is pretty funny.
这确实挺好笑的。

1523
01:04:54.100 --> 01:04:59.740
I mean, talk about a class that would make sure you worked out would be Dwight yelling at you on a spin bicycle.
我是说，如果有一节课能保证你练到位，那肯定就是德怀特在动感单车上对你大吼大叫。

1524
01:05:00.140 --> 01:05:01.160
It's so true.
太真实了。

1525
01:05:01.780 --> 01:05:04.480
Finally, we got a fan question from Sasha L.
最后，我们收到一个来自萨莎·L的粉丝提问。

1526
01:05:04.760 --> 01:05:07.500
from McAllen, Texas, who said,
她来自德克萨斯州麦卡伦，她说，

1527
01:05:07.660 --> 01:05:11.660
I noticed that this episode was dedicated to Larry Einhorn.
我注意到这一集是献给拉里·艾因霍恩的。

1528
01:05:11.900 --> 01:05:12.840
Who is that?
那是谁？

1529
01:05:13.680 --> 01:05:16.680
Well, Sasha, that was Randall Einhorn's father.
嗯，萨莎，那是兰德尔·艾因霍恩的父亲。

1530
01:05:16.680 --> 01:05:21.220
His father had passed away suddenly while we were in post-production on this episode.
我们在制作这一集的后期时，他的父亲突然去世了。

1531
01:05:21.400 --> 01:05:24.460
And it was Greg Daniels' idea to add him to the end credits.
格雷格·丹尼尔斯提议把他加到片尾字幕里。

1532
01:05:24.940 --> 01:05:25.060
Yeah.
是的。

1533
01:05:25.760 --> 01:05:27.160
Well, there you have it, guys.
好了，伙计们，这就是全部内容了。

1534
01:05:27.180 --> 01:05:28.300
That's the cover-up.
这就是真相。

1535
01:05:28.520 --> 01:05:29.880
That's the cover-up.
这就是真相。

1536
01:05:30.140 --> 01:05:32.120
Next week is The Chump.
下一集是《笨蛋》。

1537
01:05:32.700 --> 01:05:35.700
And we are winding down season six.
我们即将结束第六季了。

1538
01:05:35.960 --> 01:05:37.680
Only two more episodes to go.
只剩下最后两集了。

1539
01:05:38.080 --> 01:05:38.560
Wow.
哇。

1540
01:05:38.860 --> 01:05:39.420
I know.
我知道。

1541
01:05:39.640 --> 01:05:41.660
And then we're in Steve's final season.
然后我们就进入史蒂夫的最后一季了。

1542
01:05:41.680 --> 01:05:42.500
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1543
01:05:42.500 --> 01:05:43.800
That's going to be emotional.
那一定会很感人。

1544
01:05:44.080 --> 01:05:44.600
It is.
确实。

1545
01:05:44.700 --> 01:05:46.160
And Steve has got to come on.
史蒂夫一定要来参加。

1546
01:05:46.680 --> 01:05:49.120
Said he would come on for Goodbye, Michael.
他说他会来参加《再见，迈克尔》那一集。

1547
01:05:49.520 --> 01:05:53.360
When we reached out to him a long time ago to be on the podcast, he said,
很久以前我们联系他上播客时，他说，

1548
01:05:53.460 --> 01:05:57.760
guys, can I come on for Goodbye, Michael and just talk about it all?
伙计们，我能来聊聊《再见，迈克尔》并谈谈这一切吗？

1549
01:05:58.000 --> 01:05:59.020
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1550
01:05:59.200 --> 01:06:01.860
If Steve is able to come in the studio, I will cry.
如果史蒂夫能来到演播室，我一定会哭的。

1551
01:06:02.280 --> 01:06:02.920
I will cry.
我会哭的。

1552
01:06:03.580 --> 01:06:06.180
There's going to be a lot of crying happening in season seven.
第七季里会有很多哭戏。

1553
01:06:06.420 --> 01:06:07.260
Season seven.
第七季。

1554
01:06:07.780 --> 01:06:08.460
Buckle in.
做好心理准备吧。

1555
01:06:08.920 --> 01:06:09.220
All right.
好的。

1556
01:06:09.300 --> 01:06:10.980
Well, you guys, thank you so much for listening.
好了，各位，非常感谢你们的收听。

